#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:306
msgid ""
"<p>You choose the <b>'overwrite' correction mode</b>!<br/>Are you sure you "
"want to loose your original image files?</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Escolleu o <b>modo de corrección \"sobreescribir\"</b>!<br/>Ten certeza "
"de que quere perder os ficheiros orixinais das imaxes?</p>"

#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:309
msgid "Overwrite mode"
msgstr "Modo sobreescribir"

#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:484
msgid ""
"<p>Some of the images could not be analyzed with the current settings or "
"they do not contain any red-eyes at all.</p><p><b>Would you like to remove "
"those images from the list?</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Non se puideron analizar algunhas das imaxes coa configuración actual ou "
"non conteñen ningún ollo vermello.</p><p><b>Quere eliminar esas imaxes da "
"lista?</b></p>"

#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:490
msgid "Remove unprocessed images?"
msgstr "Eliminar as imaxes non procesadas?"

#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:522
msgid ""
"<p>You tried to add <b>RAW images</b> to the plugin,<br/>but those filetypes "
"are not supported.</p><p><b>They were automatically removed from the list.</"
"b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Tentou engadir <b>imaxes RAW</b> ao engadido,<br/>mais eses tipos de "
"ficheiro non se admiten.</p><p><b>Elimináronse automaticamente da lista.</"
"b></p>"

#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:526
msgid "RAW images found"
msgstr "Atopáronse imaxes RAW"

#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:605
#, kde-format
msgid "<p>%1 image has been successfully processed.</p>"
